======

Shard embeds and links OBS Studio's libobs and ships OBS Studio plugins
(win-capture, win-wasapi, obs-x264, obs-nvenc, obs-qsv11, obs-ffmpeg,
obs-outputs, obs-filters, image-source, text-freetype2).

